@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
autonumber

title Figure 4-2. Design Sequence: Get Journey Advice

actor "Traveler" as User
participant "Dashboard UI\n(Vue 3 + TypeScript)" as UI
participant "JourneyHandler\n(Gin)" as API
participant "Runtime" as RT
participant "data.Agent" as DA
participant "SkillRegistry\n(flight / airport / route skills)" as SK
participant "advice.Agent" as AA
participant "LLM endpoint\n(OpenAI-compatible)" as LLM
participant "MemoryStore" as Store
participant "SSEHub" as Hub

User -> UI : view journey advice
UI -> API : GET /api/v1/journey/{id}/state
API -> RT : GetSnapshot(id)
RT -> Store : GetSnapshot(id)
Store --> RT : JourneySnapshot
RT --> API : JourneySnapshot
API --> UI : 200 OK + JourneySnapshot
UI --> User : render advice.stage, advice.risk, cards and actions

== asynchronous recalculation ==
note over RT
  trigger: POST /journey, POST /journey/{id}/location or the periodic
  scheduler; per-journey recalculation is serialized (running / dirty)
end note
RT -> RT : Recalculate(id)
RT -> DA : BuildState(journey, progress)
DA -> SK : Query(missing fields)
SK -> SK : flight_status / airport_status / flight_identity (EOOB)\nroute_eta (local estimate)
SK --> DA : observations + issues
note over DA
  a failing source only adds issues; fields without evidence
  stay null; quality = complete | degraded | unknown
end note
DA --> RT : State + issues

RT -> RT : Decide: same inputs as the previous round?
alt inputs unchanged, previous advice available
  RT -> RT : reuse previous Advice (no LLM call)
else inputs changed
  RT -> AA : Evaluate(state, progress, issues, departureIATA, hasBaggage, now)
  AA -> AA : compute time facts (minutesUntilGateClose, bufferMin)
  AA -> LLM : Chat(system + user prompt, JSON mode)
  LLM --> AA : advice JSON (stage, risk, alert, cards, actions, reasons)
  AA -> AA : validate enums, clean cards, enforce risk floor,\nfill Nav links (nav symbol "airport" -> real link)
  AA --> RT : Advice
end

RT -> Store : SaveSnapshot(snapshot)
RT -> Hub : Publish(id, snapshot)
Hub --> UI : event: snapshot
UI --> User : updated advice cards and actions

note over RT
  if the new advice is empty (risk = unknown, no content) while the
  previous advice had content, the previous content is kept and the
  new issues are merged into reasons.
end note

@enduml
